Available commands   Description				       Syntax
	
help		     Print iinformation about available commands       help

clear		     Remove all the symbols from console               clear

cacl                 Calculate expresions			       calc EXPRESSION

print                Writes text in console			       print TEXT

mv                   Move file from FILE1 to FILE2, also renames file  mv FILE1 FILE2

cp                   Copy FILE1 to FILE2			       cp FILE1 FILE2

cat                  Write files in console			       cat file1 file2 ...

head		     Write first COUNT lines of file		       head COUNT FILE

tail		     Write last COUNT lines of file		       tail COUNT FILE

exit		     Exit programm				       exit

